cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Sentinel-AQ: Correctness-Verified Recovery for an Incremental Air-Quality Pipeline"
abstract: "A data-engineering study on real OpenAQ PM2.5 data from Lahore (2,438 location-days, 2019-2026): an incremental PostgreSQL/PostGIS pipeline with data contracts, versioned quality rules and idempotent loads; a golden rebuild that proves published tables equal a from-scratch rebuild; a seeded catalogue of 15 fault types; and a deterministic, policy-bounded recovery engine evaluated against plain retries (320 trials on synthetic and real data)."
authors:
